{"surface": "inspector", "title": "Shock to AAPL", "html": "<header class=\"hero\"><p class=\"kicker\">Shock</p><h2 class=\"title\"><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"name:AAPL\">AAPL</a></h2><p class=\"ctx\"><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"prop:23\">Apple guides its March-quarter gross margin below 45% on January 28</a></p></header><h3 class=\"sub\">Residual</h3><div class=\"sz\"><div class=\"sz-row st\"><div class=\"sz-lab\"><span class=\"sz-t\">Shock</span><span class=\"sz-s\" title=\"Yes\">Yes</span></div><div class=\"po-track\"><i class=\"po-zero\" style=\"left:60.808%\"></i><i class=\"sz-seg st\" style=\"left:5.357%;right:calc(100% - 60.808%)\"></i></div><div class=\"sz-v\"><span class=\"n v\">−5.00%</span></div></div><div class=\"sz-row pw\"><div class=\"sz-lab\"><span class=\"sz-t\">Oct 1 – Nov 18, 2026</span></div><div class=\"po-track\"><i class=\"po-zero\" style=\"left:60.808%\"></i><i class=\"sz-seg pw\" style=\"left:60.808%;right:calc(100% - 94.643%)\"></i></div><div class=\"sz-v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:window:link:194:0\"><span class=\"n v\">+3.05%</span></a></div></div></div><h3 class=\"sub\">Basis</h3><div class=\"basis note\"><div class=\"fold\"><div class=\"fold-in\"><div class=\"md\" data-md=\"The first step down in margin guidance cost 1.9% the next day (to $331.90 on Nov 3) before the shares rallied with the market. They now trade near a record after gaining 12% beyond the factors since Oct 1 (window), with KeyBanc calling them &#x27;at the point of extreme overvaluation&#x27; and short interest up 10%. A second step down, showing the squeeze is not one quarter long, is worth about 5% beyond what the shares would otherwise do.\"><p>The first step down in margin guidance cost 1.9% the next day (to $331.90 on Nov 3) before the shares rallied with the market. They now trade near a record after gaining 12% beyond the factors since Oct 1 (window), with KeyBanc calling them &#x27;at the point of extreme overvaluation&#x27; and short interest up 10%. A second step down, showing the squeeze is not one quarter long, is worth about 5% beyond what the shares would otherwise do.</p></div></div><button class=\"linkish more\" type=\"button\" data-more>Show more</button></div></div><h3 class=\"sub\">Levels</h3><table class=\"cmp lv\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"n\">Price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Today</th><td class=\"n\"><span class=\"n v\">$348.85</span></td></tr><tr><th>Apple guides March-quarter gross margin at 45% to 46% <span class=\"otag\">Baseline</span></th><td class=\"n\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:level:link:194\"><span class=\"n v\">$352.55</span></a></td></tr><tr><th>Apple guides March-quarter gross margin above 46%</th><td class=\"n\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:level:link:194\"><span class=\"n v\">$363.12</span></a></td></tr><tr><th>Yes</th><td class=\"n\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:level:link:194\"><span class=\"n v\">$334.92</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"raw\"><a class=\"rawlink\" data-go=\"raw:value:consequence:link:194\">Full details</a></p>", "wide": true}